# field-blur (M7): h's box (330, 557.5, 107 x 32 at 1440 x 900) clicked and "-1" typed, then a
# press on the Transform card's empty head (200, 376): the focus leaves the field, which applies
# −1.00 and closes; nothing holds the focus. Then "x" typed into k's field and the focus taken by
# a press on the panel's foot (the Points card's head, (200, 650)): not a number, so k keeps 0.00.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 383 573
wait 16
type "-1"
click 200 376
wait 1000
shot applied
click 383 468
wait 16
type "x"
click 200 650
wait 16
shot put-back
